
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Approach | Causeway"
  description="Discover how Causeway works alongside organizations to navigate complexity, ask better questions, and find a clearer path forward."
>
  <main class="approach-page">

    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->

    <section class="approach-intro">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <p class="eyebrow">How I Work</p>

        <h1>
          Comfortable in the grey.<br />
          Focused on the way forward.
        </h1>

        <p class="intro-lead">
          Complex challenges rarely come with straightforward answers.
          Finding a way forward takes curiosity, thoughtful questions,
          and a willingness to explore what might be happening beneath
          the surface.
        </p>

        <p>
          I work alongside organizations to understand their challenges,
          bring different perspectives together, and make sense of
          complexity. I don't arrive with a predetermined solution.
          Instead, I bring structure, experience, and an open mind
          to help uncover what matters and determine what comes next.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- HOW I WORK / PHOTO -->

    <section class="how-i-work">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="work-grid">

          <div class="work-content">

            <p class="eyebrow">A Thoughtful, Collaborative Process</p>

            <h2>Understanding comes before answers.</h2>

            <p>
              Every organization has its own context, history,
              relationships, and challenges. What looks like a
              straightforward problem on the surface can often
              be connected to much bigger questions.
            </p>

            <p>
              I take the time to understand the circumstances,
              listen to the people closest to the work, and explore
              different perspectives before moving toward solutions.
            </p>

            <p>
              Sometimes that means asking questions that haven't
              been asked before. Sometimes it means challenging
              assumptions, connecting information that has been
              considered separately, or helping people see a
              familiar challenge differently.
            </p>

            <p>
              The approach is intentional, but never rigid.
              The work should reflect what the situation actually
              needs, not follow a prescribed formula.
            </p>

          </div>

          <div class="work-image">
            <img
              src="/causeway-how-i-work.jpg"
              alt="Colleagues sharing ideas and enjoying a collaborative conversation in a welcoming workplace"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT -->

    <section class="expectations">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="expectations-heading">

          <p class="eyebrow">What You Can Expect</p>

          <h2>A thoughtful partner in working through complexity.</h2>

          <p>
            The way we work together matters just as much as the
            work itself. You can expect an approach that is
            collaborative, curious, and grounded in mutual respect.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="expectations-grid">

          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">01</span>

            <h3>To be heard</h3>

            <p>
              Your perspective matters. I take the time to listen,
              understand your experiences, and consider what matters
              to the people affected by the challenge.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">02</span>

            <h3>Thoughtful questions</h3>

            <p>
              Expect curiosity rather than assumptions. I'll ask
              questions, explore different perspectives, and
              challenge thinking when it helps uncover something
              important.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">03</span>

            <h3>Honest conversations</h3>

            <p>
              Meaningful progress requires openness. I create space
              for different viewpoints, constructive disagreement,
              and conversations that get beyond the surface.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">04</span>

            <h3>Clarity amid complexity</h3>

            <p>
              I'll help organize information, connect perspectives,
              identify what matters most, and bring greater clarity
              to difficult questions and decisions.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">05</span>

            <h3>A collaborative approach</h3>

            <p>
              This isn't about someone arriving with all the answers.
              We'll work together, drawing on your knowledge,
              experience, and expertise alongside mine.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="expectation">

            <span class="expectation-number">06</span>

            <h3>Practical progress</h3>

            <p>
              Insight matters, but so does what happens next.
              The goal is to translate understanding into
              meaningful decisions and achievable action.
            </p>

          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- GUIDING PRINCIPLES -->

    <section class="principles">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <p class="eyebrow">What Guides My Work</p>

        <h2>Three things that shape every engagement.</h2>

        <div class="principles-grid">

          <article class="principle">

            <span class="principle-number">01</span>

            <h3>Understand before acting.</h3>

            <p>
              The right solution starts with understanding the
              right problem. I make space for discovery, curiosity,
              and the perspectives that might otherwise be missed.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="principle">

            <span class="principle-number">02</span>

            <h3>Focus on what matters.</h3>

            <p>
              Not every issue requires the same attention.
              Evidence-informed thinking and meaningful engagement
              help identify where effort can make the greatest difference.
            </p>

          </article>


          <article class="principle">

            <span class="principle-number">03</span>

            <h3>Build lasting capability.</h3>

            <p>
              The goal isn't dependency on external expertise.
              It's to leave organizations better equipped,
              more confident, and more capable of navigating
              future challenges.
            </p>

          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- CLOSING -->

    <section class="approach-closing">

      <div class="closing-inner">

        <p class="eyebrow">Finding the Way Forward</p>

        <h2>
          Better decisions start with a better understanding.
        </h2>

        <p>
          Every engagement begins with a conversation.
          Let's explore what's happening, what matters,
          and what a clearer path forward might look like.
        </p>

        <a
          href="mailto:kchapman@causewayconsultancy.ca"
          class="approach-cta"
        >
          Let's start a conversation
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  :global(:root) {
    --slate: #23364A;
    --coastal: #668A9A;
    --stone: #C2BBA8;
    --cream: #F5F2EA;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
  }


  /* GENERAL */

  .approach-page {
    color: var(--slate);
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .section-inner {
    width: min(1120px, 86%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .approach-page h1,
  .approach-page h2,
  .approach-page h3 {
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .approach-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }

  .approach-page h2 {
    font-size: clamp(29px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    margin: 0 0 25px;
  }

  .approach-page p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }


  /* INTRODUCTION */

  .approach-intro {
    padding: 85px 0 75px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .approach-intro .section-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .approach-intro .intro-lead {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .approach-intro p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 850px;
  }


  /* HOW I WORK */

  .how-i-work {
    padding: 95px 0;
  }

  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 75px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .work-content h2 {
    max-width: 490px;
  }

  .work-content p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-bottom: 19px;
  }

  .work-image {
    height: 520px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .work-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }


  /* EXPECTATIONS */

  .expectations {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 95px 0 105px;
  }

  .expectations-heading {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  .expectations-heading h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .expectations-heading p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .expectations-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 48px 45px;
  }

  .expectation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
    padding-top: 22px;
  }

  .expectation-number {
    display: block;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .expectation h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .expectation p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }


  /* GUIDING PRINCIPLES */

  .principles {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .principles > .section-inner > h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 45px;
  }

  .principle {
    padding: 30px;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .principle-number {
    display: block;
    color: var(--coastal);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .principle p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }


  /* CLOSING */

  .approach-closing {
    background: var(--slate);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 90px 7%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .closing-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .approach-closing .eyebrow {
    color: #A9C0C8;
  }

  .approach-closing h2 {
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px);
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .approach-closing p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: #E4E9EC;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .approach-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 27px;
    border: 1px solid var(--white);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .approach-cta:hover {
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--slate);
  }


  /* TABLET */

  @media (max-width: 900px) {

    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .expectations-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .principles-grid {
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .principle {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .work-image {
      height: 450px;
    }

  }


  /* MOBILE */

  @media (max-width: 650px) {

    .section-inner {
      width: 88%;
    }

    .approach-intro {
      padding: 65px 0 55px;
    }

    .approach-intro .intro-lead {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .how-i-work {
      padding: 65px 0;
    }

    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .work-image {
      height: 340px;
      order: 2;
    }

    .expectations {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .expectations-heading {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .expectations-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .expectation {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    .principles {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .principle {
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .approach-closing {
      padding: 70px 7%;
    }

  }

</style>
